1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,914
Bon, je dois y aller !
Well, I have to go!

2
00:00:03,214 --> 00:00:07,390
Déjà ? Allez, à tout à l'heure !
Already? Okay, see you later!

3
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:11,338
Oui ! Et on se voit demain ?
Yes! And do we see each other tomorrow?

4
00:00:11,638 --> 00:00:13,870
Oui, à demain !
Yes, see you tomorrow!

5
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,138
Et vendredi ?
And Friday?

6
00:00:16,438 --> 00:00:20,854
À vendredi ! Et à bientôt pour un café.
See you Friday! And see you soon for a coffee.

7
00:00:21,154 --> 00:00:23,026
À plus !
See ya!

8
00:00:23,326 --> 00:00:26,782
Salut ! Bonne soirée !
Bye! Have a nice evening!

